          "title": "Boot is one explicit path",
          "narration": "Boot starts in main.ts. It loads the environment, creates the Nest application, installs static mounts, a global validation pipe, exception filters, and a graceful shutdown path. The app fails fast when required configuration is missing, so a broken environment never pretends to be healthy.",
