          "title": "AppModule is the wiring seam",
          "narration": "AppModule imports the feature modules that make up the service: accounts, comments, buns, threads, moderation, sync, tags, telemetry, and the rest. It also registers the global interceptor and the exception filters in a deliberate order, because filter precedence is behavior, not decoration.",
