          "id": "beat_request_03",
          "title": "The page controller is a thin adapter",
          "narration": "The public thread page is a thin adapter. The controller parses the request, applies security headers, asks ThreadPageLoader for one page state, and renders it. It does not know how comments, moderation, tags, or revisions are fetched, which is what keeps the page shape testable.",
          "durationMs": 38000,
          "anchors": [
            {
