          "id": "beat_request_04",
          "title": "The loader returns named page states",
          "narration": "ThreadPageLoader resolves the thread, the bun, the viewer, the moderation context, the comment tree, revisions, tags, and viewer relations. It returns a discriminated union of page states, so not-found, taken-down, labeled, age-gated, and error pages each have a name instead of collapsing into one vague message.",
