            "edgeIds": ["edge_service_adapter", "edge_service_writer"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "beat_write_03",
          "title": "The adapter is the PDS seam",
          "narration": "AtprotoCommentPdsAdapter.create builds the ATProto record with the thread, parent, root, author, and timestamps, then calls com.atproto.repo.createRecord on the author's agent. The adapter is the only place that knows the collection name and the repository call, which keeps the PDS shape out of the service.",
          "durationMs": 42000,
          "anchors": [
            {
