            "edgeIds": ["edge_worker_writer", "edge_worker_main"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "beat_index_02",
          "title": "Reconcile is a bounded batch",
          "narration": "ThreadReconciler lists a bun's thread records from the PDS and hands them to the writer's reconcile. A bun whose credentials vanished is skipped, so one unreadable bun does not stop the rest of the batch. Each step is timed and reported, which is how a background loop becomes observable instead of mysterious.",
          "durationMs": 40000,
          "anchors": [
            {
              "id": "anchor_thread_reconciler",
