          }
        },
        {
          "id": "beat_index_03",
          "title": "Tags are a hub, not a controller",
          "narration": "TagService resolves the actor's standing, writes the repository record or local audit row through the index write seam, and keeps the tag index in step. It is a hub of ports, not a controller. That shape is what lets tags, moderation, and the index share one write path without importing each other's modules.",
          "durationMs": 40000,
